        "mentalImage": "An assorted clear plastic container with black tempered-steel triangular clips of various widths (small 3/4-inch, medium 1 1/4-inch, large 2-inch) with shiny chrome wire handles, securely clamping a 100-page financial quarterly statement.",
        "whenNotToUse": "Do not confuse with standard wire \"paperclips\" (for a few pages), \"bulldog clips\" (which have a curved cylindrical spring and rigid flat wings), or ring binders/folders.",
