        "whenToUse": "Use when referring to clerical job postings, corporate staffing rosters, payroll classifications, or office workflow duties involving transcribing or keying data: 'The accounting firm hired three temporary data entry operators for tax season', 'The job duties of a data entry operator include verifying customer account numbers and inputting payment details.'"
