        "connotation": "neutral",
        "coreConcept": "A legally binding contractual agreement in which a lessor (such as a financial institution, leasing agency, or equipment vendor) grants a lessee (a business or organization) the right to use machinery, technological hardware, or office apparatus (such as commercial multifunction copiers, servers, or mail-sorting machines) for a designated term in return for scheduled recurring payments, typically incorporating maintenance covenants and end-of-lease purchase or renewal options.",
