        "whenToUse": "Use when describing physical courier duties, administrative off-site logistics, short courier trips, or temporary support staffing: 'The law firm hired a temporary errand runner during the high-stakes merger', 'We need an errand runner to pick up the architectural blueprints from the print shop.'"
